description = "SugarboxV2/CPCCore-based Amstrad CPC/CPC+/GX4000 core. Emulates the 464, 664, 6128, 6128+ and GX4000 models, switchable at runtime with no restart. Unlike other libretro Amstrad CPC cores, this one supports protected/flux-level disk formats (IPF/CAPS, CTRAW, HFE, SCP) in addition to plain DSK/EDSK, as well as tape (.cdt/.tap/.tzx/.csw/.voc/.wav) and .cpr cartridges. Real keyboard input requires enabling RetroArch's Game Focus mode to type commands (RUN\"/CAT) needed to launch non-cartridge content."
